  12 box  95.0   95.0    0.8 tr -47.50 0 -3.0  $ Pedestal support plate
  13 box 120.3  120.0  140.1 tr -59.85 0 47.45 $ Water & tank & BCD
  14 p x   0.0
$ --- Tie rods
  21 c z   0.5   -1.8  104.2 tr  -0.8  28.0 0
  22 c z   0.5   -1.8  104.2 tr -28.0   0.8 0
  23 c z   0.5   -1.8  104.2 tr -28.0  -0.8 0
  24 c z   0.5   -1.8  104.2 tr  -0.8 -28.0 0
